  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A call-count test fails on origin/master: many Off/Retired policies (for example 500) whose Signals are already redacted, plus a few with unredacted evidence: the sweep's Signal reads are bounded by pages of the new query, not one per policy.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Must-not-fire: every Signal with unredacted evidence of a not-in-force policy is still redacted exactly as before; already-redacted Signals are not rewritten; in-force policies' Signals are untouched; a truncated read still fails the run; existing SignalReevaluation and redaction tests pass unmodified.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The deleted-policy sweep behaves as before (unchanged or proven by tests); build, filtered tests (Signals) and full ArchTests pass; publish-size delta reported.</criterion>
